  "Prof. Francesco Lambiase, University of L'Aquila",
  "Prof. Silvio Genna, University of Rome Tor Vergata",
  "Dr. Tanvir Hussain, University of Nottingham, UK",
  "Prof. Anish Roy, Loughborough University, UK",
  "Prof. Amit Srivastava, University of Texas, US",
  "Prof. Shrikrishna N Joshi, IIT, Guwahati",
  "Prof. Uday S Dixit, IIT, Guwahati",
  "Prof. Amitava Ghosh, IIT, Madras",
  "Prof. Inderdeep Singh, IIT, Roorkee",
  "Prof. Satyaki Roy, IIT, Kanpur",
  "Prof. S. P. Singh, IIT, Delhi",
  "Prof. Josemon Jacob, IIT, Delhi",
  "Prof. Manas Das, IIT, Guwahati",
  "Prof. Pankaj Biswas, IIT, Guwahati",
  "Prof. Swarup Bag, IIT, Guwahati",
  "Prof. S. K. Shukla, IIT (BHU), Varanasi",
  "Prof. Kuldeep Singh Sagwan, Manipal University, Jaipur",
  "Prof. Aman Mahajan, GNDU, Amritsar",
